# Derived artifacts. The .md tables, .png figures and .json.gz run payloads here
# are the runs of record and ARE committed (force-added past the repo-root
# `outputs/` rule), because RESULTS.md quotes them and a reader should not have to
# spend an hour of CPU across four sweeps to check a number.
#
# The payloads are gzipped, not plain. Four stages of per-(cell, arm) records is
# 19 MB uncompressed -- 4.5x the largest artifact any other experiment here commits
# -- and 2.3 MB gzipped. Nothing reads them by eye; `analyze*.py` is the reader and
# `run_experiment.load_payload` accepts either form, so gunzipping one by hand to
# poke at it still works.
*.csv
*.json
